; Ledgeline projection
; projection: Parity step
; created: 2026-10-20
; updated: 2026-10-20

; A step change: one line in two bounded segments. `to` is exclusive and
; `from` inclusive, so February 2027 is the first month at the new figure.

~ monthly to 2027-02-01  payroll
    expenses:payroll      $5000.00  ; line: payroll
    assets:checking

~ monthly from 2027-02-01  payroll
    expenses:payroll      $8000.00  ; line: payroll
    assets:checking
